WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.673
Burkĩna Faso sẽn be Lobie soolmẽ wã, ro-kãsems wʋsg n be tɩɩsã sʋka, Loropeni tẽngã sɛɛgẽ.

00:00:07.753 --> 00:00:15.340
B ra yaa gãn-kãsemse, la b meenda ne pĩnda, n gũbg zĩ-kãseng sẽn pa tar nebã rũndã-rũndã.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.149
Yaa Loropeni sisa wã.

00:00:17.229 --> 00:00:26.539
Bãngr-gomdã wilgda vẽeneg tɩ b yaa Burkĩna Faso pipi zĩig ning UNESCO sẽn gʋls tɩ b lebg dũni-paalgã paoongã.

00:00:26.619 --> 00:00:36.015
B yaa tãb-biis nins b sẽn tigim ne kugã sẽn tar pãng zĩ-kãnga sʋka, la yaa bãmb n tar pãng n yɩɩd b taabã fãa.

00:00:36.095 --> 00:00:39.116
La ãnda n naan-b lame, la bõe yĩnga?

00:00:39.196 --> 00:00:41.700
Rẽ n so tɩ yel-solemdã sɩngre.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:52.985
Bãngr-goam kẽer yetame tɩ Lobi neb nins sẽn be tẽn-kãng pʋgẽ rũndã-rũndã wã yãame tɩ b yaab-rãmbã sẽn wa n wa wã, b ra zoe n yãame.

00:00:53.065 --> 00:01:00.997
Kibs-mitb la tẽn-kʋdemdb yetame tɩ bũmb toor-toor n be, la b pa bãng tɩ bũmb fãa yaa sɩda ye.

00:01:01.077 --> 00:01:13.918
Bũmb a ye la b nong n maand n wilg tɩ tẽn-kãng ra tara sãnem wʋsgo, tɩ b tõe n yeel t'a yaa sãnem raab ning sẽn da kɩtd tɩ Afirik Wɛtgã kẽed ne teedã.

00:01:13.998 --> 00:01:18.656
B ra tõe n kogla teedã, nebã, la soolem a ye pãn-tõogã.

00:01:18.736 --> 00:01:31.922
Kẽer vaeesdb ket n zabda ne b sẽn tõe n bãng sẽn yaa yʋʋm ning site wã sẽn nan yɩ to-to wã, la sẽn na yɩl n bãng neb nins sẽn naan-a wã sẽn yaa ãnd dãmba.

00:01:32.002 --> 00:01:41.398
Neb nins sẽn dag n be we-rãmbã poorẽ, la b sẽn da gũud-b to-to wã, b gomda bũmb nins sẽn da maand pĩndã yelle.

00:01:41.478 --> 00:01:43.294
Loropeni kugã sĩndame.

00:01:43.374 --> 00:01:52.597
La b sokda b sãambã fãa sokre, la b tẽegd-b tɩ Afirik Wɛtgã kibarã yaa pĩnd wẽndẽ n yɩɩd neb kẽer sẽn tẽedã.
